@startuml
left to right direction

actor "Logged-in Reader" as Reader
actor "External Book\nData Service" as BookData
actor "Follower of\nthe Reader" as Follower

rectangle "BookWyrm" {
    usecase "Record Finishing\na Book" as UC1
    usecase "Publish a\nBook Review" as UC2
    usecase "Import Reading\nHistory" as UC3
}

Reader --> UC1
Reader --> UC2
Reader --> UC3

BookData --> UC3 : provides book data

Follower ..> UC1 : interested in shared update
Follower ..> UC2 : interested in published review

note bottom of UC1
Follower interest applies when
the reader posts the completion
update to the feed.
end note

note bottom of UC3
External lookup may be used when
a book cannot be resolved locally.
end note

@enduml